@page "/Anonymous/FailureInAnonymousFolderPage"
@attribute [Authorize(Policy = Policy.FailurePolicy)]

<h1>Failure in Anonymous Folder</h1>
<p>
    Since this explicitly applies <code>@Policy.FailurePolicy</code> you'd expect that you couldn't see it, but because we have <code>AllowAnonymous</code> in <code>_Imports.razor</code> the
    policies that we have specified don't apply; <code>AllowAnonymous</code> takes precedence!
</p>